  "companyOverview": [
    {
      "id": "overview",
      "text": {
        "zh": "北港3D不仅是品牌视觉的塑造者，更是品牌数字营销的推广者。23 年深耕，活力依然！北港3D始终专注于为谋求长远发展的企业，提供从品牌塑造与升级、数字营销平台搭建与运维、到文化空间标识设计与落地的一体化服务——以“策划—设计—营销”的全链路解决方案，赋能企业品牌价值成长。北港3D设计正活跃于长三角腹地，服务的城市包括上海、苏州、南通、无锡、常州、泰州、张家港、江阴、太仓、昆山、常熟、靖江、如皋、浙江、南京、湖州、嘉兴、重庆等地。",
        "en": "Beigang3D is not only a shaper of brand visuals but also a promoter of brand digital marketing. With 23 years of deep cultivation, its vitality endures! Beigang3D focuses on providing integrated services for enterprises seeking long-term development—from brand building and upgrading, digital marketing platform setup and O&M, to cultural-space signage design and implementation—empowering brand value growth through a full-chain planning-design-marketing solution. Beigang3D is active across the Yangtze River Delta hinterland, serving cities including Shanghai, Suzhou, Nantong, Wuxi, Changzhou, Taizhou, Zhangjiagang, Jiangyin, Taicang, Kunshan, Changshu, Jingjiang, Rugao, Zhejiang, Nanjing, Huzhou, Jiaxing, Chongqing and more."
      }
    }
  ],
